"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4709950","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3934180-1846651706688977","game_id":"steam-3934180","kind":"announcement","title":"DON MEMO AT NEXT FEST!","summary":"¡Pura Vida!How's it going, guys? We're working our hardest here at Don Memo to finish the game... Today we've got some really exciting news for you.DON MEMO WILL BE AT NEXT FEST!That's right, our brave bull is heading to one of the most anticipated festivals for Steam players, where they'll be able to check out tons of available games, demos, upcoming releases, and great discounts...And we made the front page!Let your friends know about our participation in the event, and help us gain more visib","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:30:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688977","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3934180-1844115010487875","game_id":"steam-3934180","kind":"announcement","title":"HAPPY INDEPENDENCE DAY!!! CELEBRATE IT WITH DON MEMO!!","summary":"¡Pura Vida!How's it going, guys? We're working hard here at Don Memo to improve the demo... And check this out, we've got some really cool news to celebrate September 15, Costa Rica's Independence Day...SAN JOSÉ IS COMING TO THE DON MEMO DEMO!That's right, the capital of our beloved country is coming to Don Memo on September 15! Now you can explore the heart of this province, wander through its crowded streets, pass by the buildings under construction, and explore its most famous avenues, all of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T01:35:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010487875","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3934180-1842212951314682","game_id":"steam-3934180","kind":"announcement","title":"DON MEMO IS PARTYING! NOW ON PLATAFORMER FEVER!!!","summary":"¡Pura Vida!How's it going, guys? We're working hard here at Don Memo to improve the demo... And check this out, we've got some really cool news for you.Don Memo is coming to the Platformer Fever Festival!!An event where you can check out tons of available games, demos, and upcoming releases in every category... And Don Memo is in the spotlight!Let your friends know about our participation in the event, and help us gain more visibility, we'd really appreciate your support.Remember to follow us on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T20:46:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314682","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3934180-1839676055896582","game_id":"steam-3934180","kind":"update","title":"¡Actualicese, Mae! Patch Update","summary":"¡Pura Vida!How's it going, guys? We're here, working on Don Memo to bring you new stuff for the demo.Remember to follow us on our Social Media to stay up-to-date with new news sooner. You can also join our Discord server to report any new bugs you find; we're keeping a close eye on things.Without further ado, here's the new stuff:Important:Don Memo is available for Mac OS, the adventure of our brave bull goes much further.Fixes:Adjustments to the camera and overworld map.Fix for the pause menu.I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T05:37:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055896582","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3934180-1837955055355697","game_id":"steam-3934180","kind":"announcement","title":"WE'RE EXPANDING!! NOW ON MAC OS, MAE!","summary":"¡Pura Vida!How's it going, folks? We're working hard here at Don Memo to improve the demo... And check this out, we've got some really cool news for you.DON MEMO IS NOW AVAILABLE ON MAC OS!The adventures of our beloved Bull are now available on macOS platforms. For all those who own a Mac, enjoy Costa Rica as a video game... and with new features for everyone!Remember to follow us on social media so you can see what's coming up. You can also join our Discord to report any new bugs you find; we'r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T03:32:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055355697","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3934180-1835236783556211","game_id":"steam-3934180","kind":"update","title":"¡Actualicese, Mae! Patch Update","summary":"¡Pura Vida!How's it going, guys? We're here, working on Don Memo to bring you new stuff for the demo.Remember to follow us on our Social Media to stay up-to-date with new news sooner. You can also join our Discord server to report any new bugs you find; we're keeping a close eye on things.Without further ado, here's the new stuff:FixesFix ToastFix Don Memo’s accelarationSignal modified and movedSound in Checkpoints and FontsStaircase correction on all mapsFix creditsFix healingFix qualityFix jum","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T00:14:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783556211","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3934180-1833968530892626","game_id":"steam-3934180","kind":"announcement","title":"VENGA MAE!! QUE YA SALIO!!","summary":"¡PURA VIDA!The Bear Sneeze and Colorblind_Pixel team are happy to announce the arrival of the Don Memo Demo on Steam. After so much hard work, we can finally show you a large part of our little project.First, we want to thank all our followers who were attentive to this wonderful project, both cheering us on and giving us feedback throughout the development process. You guys are awesome!But don't worry, we have more to offer! At 6:00 PM (GMT-6), the game developers will be live and ready for you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-30T00:45:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530892626","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3934180-1833334318578396","game_id":"steam-3934180","kind":"announcement","title":"¡MAES, DON MEMO IS ALMOST HERE ON STEAM!","summary":"¡Pura Vida!Maes, we are happy to announce the arrival of Don Memo on Steam, who has the mission of venturing through Costa Rica to rescue his granddaughter from that Pisuicas.Together with Colorblind Pixel, creator and pixel artist, who showed us the step-by-step development of this beautiful project through his social media, we've poured a ton of love into the provinces, designs, sprites, iconic figures, and much more. Vieran la breteada we've put in (especially these last few weeks), and we ho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T02:16:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318578396","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3934180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"ne